        <formula>ISPICKVAL(fferpcore__DocumentStatus__c, &apos;Complete&apos;)</formula>
        <inlineHelpText>Indicates whether a sales invoice or credit note is automatically created from the billing document. This is selected when the billing document is completed.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>DEPRECATED: Auto Create Sales Invoice</label>
